---
import SlideFolio from '@components/deck/SlideFolio.astro';
---

<section class="deck-slide" id="s04-siloed" data-slot="siloed">
  <SlideFolio number={4} label="Silos" />
  <div class="deck-inner">
    <p class="deck-eyebrow reveal-item">Funds as instruments</p>
    <h2 class="deck-title mt-6 max-w-[22ch] reveal-item" style="--delay: 90ms">
      Impact, Transformation, and Returns are hamstrung by a very <span class="gradient-text">siloed reality.</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-[var(--deck-gap)] md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="deck-panel reveal-item" style="--delay: 220ms">
        <p class="deck-body text-foreground">
          Fund managers only manage whatever kind of instrument or vehicle that they manage, they almost never have more than one fund structure instrument.
        </p>
        <p class="deck-body mt-4 text-muted-foreground">Why? It's the way the industry grew up. It has always been. No other reason.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="deck-panel reveal-item" style="--delay: 340ms">
        <p class="deck-body text-foreground">
          We believe funds are instruments of change. And we need a symphony of instruments to create the change we need.
        </p>
        <p class="deck-body mt-4 text-muted-foreground">No single instrument can play every note.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
